{"id": "EUVD-2026-97491", "enisaUuid": "c406208c-d9b7-3618-8087-41350196d054", "description": "QloApps through 1.7.0 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability in back-office AJAX handlers of AdminOrdersController, AdminBookingDocumentController, AdminProductsController and AdminAddHotelController that skip htl_access hotel checks. Hotel-restricted employees can supply other hotels' sequential identifiers to read, upload and delete booking documents and delete rooms, room images and hotel images.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T15:16:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T12:03:15", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Qloapps/QloApps/pull/1922", "https://github.com/Qloapps/QloApps/commit/83eb851cf106b51a4478f84a6d1658d7c8076258", "https://github.com/Qloapps/QloApps/blob/v1.7.0/controllers/admin/AdminOrdersController.php#L3799-L3877", "https://hackmd.io/@leediay/ry_M5yqoGe", "https://github.com/Qloapps/QloApps", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/qloapps-through-1.7.0-insecure-direct-object-reference-in-back-office-ajax-handlers"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109393", "GHSA-2whx-wf37-6c2h"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2b8fa9da-996a-3e0e-b5e4-a26fa839723c", "product": {"name": "QloApps", "vendor": {"name": "Webkul"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5ae06f91-d02d-301a-96f8-5b9b2770f278", "vendor": {"name": "Webkul"}}], "isExploited": false}